    <string name="formula_title">Ranking &amp; Selection Formula:</string>
    <string name="formula_desc">1. Unplayed tracks: Enter with 50 points to guarantee a fair chance in smart shuffle.\n2. First impression: The 50 placeholder resets immediately. Skipping before 20s resets score to 20 (Disliked); listening through resets to 80 (Gold affinity).\n3. Subsequent plays: Early skip subtracts 20 points; full play adds +20 points.\n4. Fatigue protection: Skips within 8 minutes of recent play bypass penalty to prevent false dislikes.\n5. Weighted Shuffle: Selection probability is proportional to (Score)^1.3.</string>
